# DUKA Project Governance

- Treat `PROJECT-SPEC.md` as the product-level source of truth for high-level scope and business direction.
- Keep detailed implementation specs in feature docs under `docs/features/`.
- For every new feature or major change, create or update:
  - `docs/features/<feature-slug>/feature.md`
- Do not start implementation before the feature docs define scope, assumptions, and acceptance criteria.
- Keep architecture simple in phase-1; avoid advanced systems unless explicitly requested.
